    "detailed_description": "<strong>Grab your wooden sword and walkie-talkie. Traverse Spacetime. Face the Essence of Evil.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/8e0478e6847af82c052ecd87e4b4fab6.avif?t=1752113201\" /></div><br><strong>A GAME ABOUT GOOD AND EVIL</strong><br><br>You Play as Davus, a 12 years old boy who must survive a Journey in a world filled with strange happenings and Evil manifestations. <br>Only you can find the Evil Presence responsible for bringing Panic to his Hometown.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br><strong> \u2022 The Walkie Talkie - </strong>   A mysterious device with magic properties. It looks an ordinary object, but there is something special about it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/865b6224b623d2fc794c44655c6bc1ea.poster.avif?t=1752113201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/865b6224b623d2fc794c44655c6bc1ea.webm?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/865b6224b623d2fc794c44655c6bc1ea.mp4?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong> \u2022 Jump to explore - </strong>  Climb up platforms and mountain peaks in search of new destinations.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a52a6023fa6801041de865e3f79b93b2.poster.avif?t=1752113201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a52a6023fa6801041de865e3f79b93b2.webm?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a52a6023fa6801041de865e3f79b93b2.mp4?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Combine your fighting skills - </strong> Create different strategies to advance upon the fleshy creatures in your way.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a57d6762c4d05209c897e0dee33d4f3e.poster.avif?t=1752113201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a57d6762c4d05209c897e0dee33d4f3e.webm?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a57d6762c4d05209c897e0dee33d4f3e.mp4?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Team up with your dog - </strong> Take advantage of the fight or hide when Einstein starts chasing the critters. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/ac6472fc7b7326299046db6fb238c3e6.poster.avif?t=1752113201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/ac6472fc7b7326299046db6fb238c3e6.webm?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/ac6472fc7b7326299046db6fb238c3e6.mp4?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/2ae9a8db5ce8b18e41ca8e9dc454ed14.avif?t=1752113201\" /></div>",
