tore_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a52a6023fa6801041de865e3f79b93b2.mp4?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Combine your fighting skills - </strong> Create different strategies to advance upon the fleshy creatures in your way.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a57d6762c4d05209c897e0dee33d4f3e.poster.avif?t=1752113201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a57d6762c4d05209c897e0dee33d4f3e.webm?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a57d6762c4d05209c897e0dee33d4f3e.mp4?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Team up with your dog - </strong> Take advantage of the fight or hide when Einstein starts chasing the critters. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/ac6472fc7b7326299046db6fb238c3e6.poster.avif?t=1752113201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/ac6472fc7b7326299046db6fb238c3e6.webm?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/ac6472fc7b7326299046db6fb238c3e6.mp4?t=1752113201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/2ae9a8db5ce8b18e41ca8e9dc454ed14.avif?t=1752113201\" /></div>",
